# Dog Companion — Privacy Policy

**Effective date:** November 15, 2026
**Developer:** AxiomaraGames
**Contact:** axiomaragames@gmail.com

Dog Companion ("the app") is a guide for dog owners: breed profiles, care, nutrition, health, training, behavior and exercise guides, activity ideas, daily tips, a breed scanner and a dog quiz. This policy explains what information the app handles, and lists the credits and licences of the software, fonts and pictures it is built with.

## Summary

The app does not collect, transmit, sell or share any personal data. Everything you do in it stays on your device.

## Information the app stores on your device

To work, the app saves the following, **only on your device**:

- **Favorite breeds:** the breeds you mark with the heart
- **Quiz scores:** your best score in each quiz topic
- **Settings:** whether you have seen the welcome screen, and whether the full version has been unlocked
- **Breed scans:** how many scans the free version has used, and the last photo you scanned (in the app's temporary storage, replaced by the next scan)

The app starts empty: it contains no pre-filled favorites, scores or other personal content. This information is never sent to us or to anyone else. You can clear your favorites and quiz scores in Settings, and everything is deleted when you uninstall the app or clear its data in your device's settings.

**Photos:** the app only reads a photo when you choose one yourself in your device's photo picker, or take one for the breed scanner. The photo is never uploaded.

**Breed scanner:** when you scan a photo, a small image-recognition model built into the app looks at it on your device, without an internet connection. The photo is not sent anywhere.

## Purchases

The app is free to download. The full version is a one-time in-app purchase made through Google Play. Google Play handles the payment under Google's own terms and privacy policy; we never see your payment details. The app only asks Google Play whether the full version has been bought on your Google account, so it can unlock it, also after a reinstall or on a new device.

## What the app does not do

- It does not ask you to create an account or sign in.
- It does not connect to our servers or any other server, apart from Google Play for the purchase described above. All breed profiles, guides and pictures are built into the app.
- It does not collect analytics, crash reports, location, contacts, photos or device identifiers. Photos you scan stay on your device.
- It does not show ads and contains no advertising or tracking software.
- It does not use your microphone, and it does not open the camera itself: for the breed scanner's "Take a photo" it asks your phone's own camera app for one photo, which you take there. The app needs no camera permission.

## Children

The app is a general reference about dogs and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children, because we collect no information at all.

## Health information

The care and health information in the app is general guidance and is not veterinary advice. Always ask a veterinarian about your own dog's health.

## Changes to this policy

If this policy changes, the new version will be published at this address with a new effective date. Because the app collects no data, any change will not affect information you have already given us.

## Contact

Questions about this policy: axiomaragames@gmail.com

